  "bodyHash": "c6c9e2de9af8ef64",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m5JXNZi.png?1\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a> 模組才能運作！</strong></p>\n<p>此資源包讓所有礦石（不含煤炭）帶有乾淨的輪廓並發出微光，在挖掘時更容易發現。它專為搭配光影模組使用而設計，因為光影通常會讓洞穴變暗並降低礦石的能見度。此資源包透過提升對比度來解決這個問題，同時不會破壞沉浸感。</p>\n<p>除了發光效果外，礦石還配備了乾淨的連接邊框，不僅提升了可讀性，也讓你更容易注意到礦脈。當礦石部分被熔岩覆蓋、躲在方塊後面或位於其他難以看見的位置時，這也能讓礦石更加顯眼。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/10XlIcD.png\" width=\"458\" height=\"258\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BRivw2D.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"41\"></span></p>\n<p>💡自發光材質</p>\n<p>🧩連接材質</p>\n<p>具備這些特性的方塊：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xM3aJYu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;鑽石礦</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LFyKY9E.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;翡翠礦</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kmuTe3Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;銅礦</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CNtIu0l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;紅石礦</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Knfi1gx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;青金石礦</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KABxb8o.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;金礦</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RvRYyBv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;鐵礦</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cBxAhk6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;原礦方塊</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rdJq75Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;下界礦石</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Y1yf1jb\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Y1yf1jb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"41\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/letN_Cn2UDw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>鬍子哥（Bearded Goof）YT 頻道：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYshYfEfdDm-YTLP6QPLuXA\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYshYfEfdDm-YTLP6QPLuXA</a></p>",
